19 |     fn area(&self) -> f64;
   |        ---- declared first here
...
25 |     fn area(&self) -> f64;
   |        ^^^^ declared again here
   |
   = note: `#[cgp_auto_dispatch]` names the items it generates after the method alone, so both traits generate `ComputeArea` and `__compute_area__`
   = help: rename `area` in one of the two traits, or declare the traits in different modules

